      "cooked": "<p>I'm currently making a Legacy Ring for myself<br>\nI found something very interesting</p>\n<p>the script size shown on the Legacy Ring card would not fit \"Furthering your Fathers Legacy\" on an actual ring<br>\n<br>\nso is the size wrong on the card for art's sake :)</p>\n<p>or does it say less e.g.\" Furthering the Legacy\"?<br>\n<br>\n&nbsp;</p>",
